269	     * What the sales tax is charged on: the taxable lines (leaving out tax-free ones) less the discount
270	     * taken off them, to the cent. On a tax-inclusive invoice that is what is left of them once the tax
271	     * and levy inside them are taken out.
272	     */
273	    public BigDecimal getTaxableBase() {
274	        BigDecimal gross = getDiscountedTaxable();
275	        return taxInclusive ? gross.subtract(getTax()).subtract(getLevy()) : gross;
